depends append
send 1
a store 1 +flags.silent f1
# f1 is new to the mailbox, so the flag list is announced
receive 3
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen f1)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen f1 \*)] permanent flags
a OK done
send 1
b fetch 1 flags
receive 2
* 1 FETCH (FLAGS (\Recent f1))
b OK done
end
